  "body": "All agents buyers welcome, contact Jayden for conjunctional.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a peaceful and desirable street, this beautifully designed standalone home delivers stylish, low-maintenance living with a layout perfectly suited to modern family life.\r\n\r\nImmaculately presented throughout, the home features a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, thoughtfully designed for everyday living and effortless entertaining. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow extends to the decking, creating an inviting space to relax and enjoy the outdoors. A single internal-access garage adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four well-appointed bedrooms and two bathrooms provide plenty of space for the family, including a generous master bedroom with its own ensuite. A second living area adds flexibility, making it ideal for family time, children or simply enjoying a little extra space.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully crafted with both style and functionality in mind, the home showcases refined interiors, quality finishes and a practical layout that balances comfort, privacy and modern convenience.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate being zoned for highly sought-after Pigeon Mountain School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College. Half Moon Bay Marina is just moments away, offering easy ferry commuting, boating, waterfront dining and weekend leisure. The beautiful eastern beaches and Highland Park Shopping Centre are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nStylish, easy-care and exceptionally well positioned, this is a home that brings together modern comfort, convenience and an enviable East Auckland lifestyle.",
